  "_comment": [
    "Every language of ORBIT. tools/make_assets.py draws the words as pictures and copies the rules to watchface/sizes.js.",
    "zepp: language codes of the watch (Zepp OS 'Multilingual Mapping'). group: thousands separator ('.', 'space' or ''),",
    "decimal: ',' or '.', minGroup: 2 = no separator below 10,000 (CLDR). Month and weekday words follow Unicode CLDR,",
    "'months' in the form used after the day (genitive where the language needs it).",
    "dates: the three date styles of the editor as tokens: d / dd day, m / mm month, yyyy year,",
    "MONTH long month, MON short month, WD short weekday, ' ' a space,",
    "'.' '/' '-' ',' signs. titles: names in the watchface editor."
